# Anchored: a bare `data/` matches a directory named data at ANY depth, which
# silently untracked every modules/local/*/tests/data fixture -- nine module test
# suites that passed only on the working copy where the files happened to sit,
# and failed on any fresh clone. This rule is for the repo-root data dir.
/data/
results/
.DS_Store
testing/
testing*
*.pyc
null/
run_*
